  "details": "Sometimes when joining a world and rejoining you’ll see another you in the instance I’m not sure how to reproduce it but a description of what happened is I had joined some friends and then left and rejoined a bit later they were in the same instance and there was another me in the middle of the world I could click on it and it would show my profile but no contents it had my username and represented group I’m not the only one experiencing this problem either multiple people on the discord have also reported this happening, if someone else has reported this issue already please merge this post with that one it really freaked me out seeing another version of myself in a world\n\nPossible recreation steps\n\nJoin world that is built close to 0,0,0 in unity so you can see this bug\n\nGo to menu and rejoin the instance\n\nA duplicate of you will be at 0,0,0 in the world",
